  "description": "Microsoft Semantic Kernel connector (IChatCompletionService) for LiteRtLmSharp on-device LLM inference — a thin layer over the LiteRtLmSharp.Extensions.AI IChatClient. Companion to the LiteRtLmSharp package. Unofficial community bindings, not affiliated with or endorsed by Google. LiteRT is a trademark of Google LLC.",
