  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: LiteRT-LM v0.14.0 natives. Opt-in stateful conversations for the .NET AI connectors (MEAI ConversationId contract — live native conversation, no history re-prefill, incremental tool loops); KV overflow guard (clamps replies to the remaining context and throws LiteRtContextOverflowException instead of corrupting the native runtime, with a same-turn IsContextFull / FinishReason.Length signal); CPU thread counts; LoRA surface; per-send output cap; tool-call streaming; RenderPreface; native system-message fix. Source-compatible with 1.0.0. Built against LiteRT-LM v0.14.0. Full notes: https://github.com/OrihuelaConde/LiteRtLmSharp/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
